config VIDEO_IMX296
	tristate "Sony IMX296 sensor support (Raspberry Pi Global Shutter Camera)"
	depends on I2C && VIDEO_DEV
	depends on MEDIA_CAMERA_SUPPORT
	select MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	select VIDEO_V4L2_SUBDEV_API
	select V4L2_FWNODE
	select REGMAP_I2C
	help
	  The Sony IMX296 driver from Raspberry Pi's kernel (1 MIPI CSI-2
	  lane, global shutter), with the bus configuration, frame interval
	  and link frequency the Rockchip CSI-2 D-PHY and ISP drivers need.

	  The module is called imx296.

